WEBVTT

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.132
Jeremy Crawford.

00:05:03.433 --> 00:05:06.002
And probably so many more.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:07.971
But tonight,

00:05:07.971 --> 00:05:11.441
I want to tell you the story
of just one of them.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:14.511
Alec Smith.

00:05:15.478 --> 00:05:17.480
When he turned 26,

00:05:17.514 --> 00:05:20.483
he could no longer be covered
by his parents' insurance.

00:05:21.284 --> 00:05:24.654
His job, however,
didn't provide insurance,

00:05:24.654 --> 00:05:29.192
and with the cheapest insurance plan
having a 7,500-dollar deductible,

00:05:29.192 --> 00:05:31.394
he decided just to go uninsured.